{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xHWa92wsUQ1795736126.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港信貸截至9月底止中期，按年多賺三成九，純利3,807萬元，主要受惠於利息收入增長近一成二，至接近8,600萬元。</p><p></p><p>中期息每股派1.6仙，與去年度同期相同。</p><p></p><p>期內利息收入淨額超過8,000萬元，增長一成一。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:43:57.346079+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T23:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T05:37:17.430167+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T00:37:18.634800+00:00","content_hash":"ab0f00bae043ec84c4bc9f42a7b554723895661c3a72967bb63328c6e6d25150","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}